                %em Cell complexes, poset topology and the representation theory of algebras arising in algebraic combinatorics and discrete geometry
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1508.05446"}> arXiv:1508.05446
                )
          %p Split bands and the skeleton of a band are defined in:
          %ul
            %li#MB78
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Donald+McAlister"}> Donald McAlister
                ,
                = succeed "," do
